	<string>MainMenu</string>
	<key>NSPrincipalClass</key>
	<string>NSApplication</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>我们使用您的音频数据进行语音识别。您的数据由系统处理；我们不会收集这些信息 / We use your audio data for speech recognition. Your data is processed by system; we do not collect that information.</string>
